84	    /** Every pool on the sheet with its members, its total share and whether it is balanced. A retired
85	     *  member (a retirement date set, whatever the date) counts their share as given toward the total
86	     *  (but has no part of the cuts, see {@link #cuts}); a member whose
87	     *  from- and to-dates do not include the sheet's today is left out (no share toward the total, no
88	     *  cut). A member may be
89	     *  another pool. A pool that is a member of none has the sheet's pot; a pool that is a member of
90	     *  another has its cut there as its pot (none when the pool above is unbalanced or has none). Each
91	     *  member of a balanced pool with a pot has a cut of it (see {@link #cuts}); otherwise, none. */
92	    public List<PoolResponse> onSheet(String sheetId) {
93	        List<BigDecimal> pots = jdbc.query("SELECT pot FROM sheet_setting WHERE sheet_id = ?",
94	                (rs, i) -> rs.getBigDecimal(1), sheetId);
95	        BigDecimal pot = pots.isEmpty() || pots.get(0) == null ? null : pots.get(0).setScale(2);
96	        Map<String, List<PoolMemberResponse>> members = new LinkedHashMap<>();
97	        Map<String, BigDecimal> totals = new LinkedHashMap<>();
